        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLPAR, Beaded Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rose pairs a beautifully beaded knob with a lined rosette for a stunning combination that exemplifies the attention to detail and quality for which Grandeur is known. The Soleil Rosette with Parthenon Knob is easy to install and will fit on most standard interior  pre-drilled doors. This knobset can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Beaded Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLPAR Soleil Rosette with Parthenon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.15\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLPAR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262392\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLPAR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rose",
                "description": "The Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rose pairs a beautifully beaded knob with a lined rosette for a stunning combination that exemplifies the attention to detail and quality for which Grandeur is known. The Soleil Rosette with Parthenon Knob is easy to install and will fit on most standard interior  pre-drilled doors. This knobset can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Beaded Parthenon Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in a wide array of finishes.",
